{"version":1,"content":"<p>三星電子正計劃在中國西安的第二座晶圓廠大幅提升V9 NAND閃存的生產規模，但新增產能預計主要服務於AI數據中心所需的企業級SSD，而非普通消費級存儲產品。據《首爾經濟日報》援引業內人士消息，三星計劃在2027年底前，將西安X2廠V9 NAND的月產量提高至目前的大約五倍。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587924.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T06:43:53.601321+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T06:34:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T06:37:13.741601+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T06:37:13.741601+00:00","content_hash":"7e3507795b981e86e52213fd28d91d28322302ac38dc27f5b5c4bf33cb53f621","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}